      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\nRESET
      LEADING COLOR : how ?\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":834.0,"y":416.0},"guid":"9a9722d5-4e09-4a50-8e0d-75dd39cc9aac","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"3516"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"trigger","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"171"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"70070c3e-dd7f-420d-ad16-85e1105eccfe","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"3490"},"sourceKey":"ifTrue","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"18"},"destinationKey":"assign","guid":"1854e493-3b15-4e81-ba69-f7e25c67a467","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"3484"},"sourceKey":"ifFalse","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"24"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"819939fd-282d-4613-864d-f1b9db571658","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"3484"},"sourceKey":"ifTrue","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"28"},"destinationKey":"In","guid":"fc180fa4-8cbe-4790-af20-1f408921397a","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"3510"},"sourceKey":"ifFalse","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"3490"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"69687871-6b98-4b7f-8d4e-d8695fa6f4f4","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"169"},"sourceKey":"trigger","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"3510"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"a13cee99-7d31-410f-aae7-d90d77e7483b","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"22"},"sourceKey":"trigger","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"3484"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"41a2f080-c026-4cc0-9ebf-7b101693d36a","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"3510"},"sourceKey":"ifTrue","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"3512"},"destinationKey":"assign","guid":"fc3edb89-fd45-482b-81fb-6a3a8b814ede","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit"